Wave your hands. You are not alone in the big tower. Race your friends to the top. Who is the fastest climber? Who has the strongest arms?\n\nFriend slipped? **OOPS!** Friend is falling... down, down, down. Don't laugh! Okay, maybe laugh a little. It is funny. Wait for them at the top or keep going? You decide. Monke leader stays at the top!\n\n# The Tower Never Ends\n\nNew updates. New towers. New ways to fall. Found a bug? Don't cry. Monke love bugs. Monke hug the bug. We fix it together. Join the tribe, talk to other monkeys, tell us your dreams.", "short_description": "Climb to the top with monkey agility! Overcome the toughest obstacles, race your friends, and be the first to reach the summit of Tower of Monkey. Don't fall!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://liminagames.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Limina Games", "support_website_url": "https://liminagames.com/discord", "website_url": "https://liminagames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "528142316460358"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1700921480735423"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "977398288682606"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 3, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1007099075709459"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1096492556041419"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1047923421003361"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1047923421003361"}, 